OL,3,ACelebrations in Serbia after veteran
OL,4,Aruler VuDMiDG loses election to
OL,5,Astudent-led protest movement
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It is clear we have lost these
OL,8,Felections," right-wing populist leader
OL,9,FVuDMiDG said as he conceded. With 97%
OL,10,Fof polling stations counted, Serbia's
OL,11,Felection commission said the students
OL,12,Fhad won 2.25 million votes and the
OL,13,Fformer ruling party 1.67 million.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
